    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957130/extras/0b1769105411e75a31a8986a45d12582.avif?t=1752129113\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the bugscraper. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1c In this <strong>roguelike shooter</strong>, you play as Mio and his friends, employees of a bug-filled skyscraper, who are fed up with their jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1b On your way to your boss's office, you'll have to face <strong>waves of enemies</strong> on each floor in a tight elevator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1d Using a wide variety of <strong>weapons and upgrades</strong>, eliminate them and prepare to battle for the next floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1e Play <strong>solo</strong>, or with up to 4 friends in <strong>local co-op multiplayer</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957130/extras/0b1769105411e75a31a8986a45d12582.avif?t=1752129113\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the bugscraper. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1c In this <strong>roguelike shooter</strong>, you play as Mio and his friends, employees of a bug-filled skyscraper, who are fed up with their jobs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1b On your way to your boss's office, you'll have to face <strong>waves of enemies</strong> on each floor in a tight elevator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1d Using a wide variety of <strong>weapons and upgrades</strong>, eliminate them and prepare to battle for the next floor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\udc1e Play <strong>solo</strong>, or with up to 4 friends in <strong>local co-op multiplayer</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
